What is a Junction Box?
Junction Box is an enclosure designed to protect electrical connections, ensuring safety by preventing short circuits and fires while maintaining reliable, long-lasting wire joints. By housing these junctions securely, the need for expensive, inefficient individual wire runs back to main service panels is effectively eliminated, making electrical installations more organized and maintainable.
